gKEICAgIDWiMrJdg\u0026t\u003d27\u0026cb_client\u003dmaps_sv.tactile\u0026fid\u003d0x0:0xaec64ccb1bdbff4e"]],1,null,null,null,null,null,null,["0","-5852906230491906226"],null,null,[null,1],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURXaU55Sl9RRRAB"]],"CIHM0ogKEICAgIDWiMrJdg",1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["位於新莊運動公園一周邊之公園路上，每每路走時總會經過，加上閱讀其他評論頗佳，已備註想去的餐廳於今晚蒞臨享受美食。\n店內桌椅位置擺放之設計，讓用餐食客感覺不會擁擠很讚，點餐後先結帳，相對節省員工服務客人時間，送上餐點後客人自行取用餐具～觀察以晚餐時間之換桌率，加上Food Panda/Uber Eats路續多人進店取餐，更開心今晚就是吃對啦！\n湯頭很不錯(點餐時口頭告知希望可調淡一些)，肉片很軟，麵的部份則是對個人口感稍軟些，不過整體感覺吃起來很順口~好吃好吃……\n於假期結束前開心分享👍",null,[0,171]]]],[null,1647535457000000,1647535457000000,"4 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfQUFWSXBTWUo5M0ZrY01rckFBQS1JZw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfQUFWSXBTWUo5M0ZrY01rckFBQS1JZxoTQ2d3STRjck5rUVlRLU92cG5RRQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiu7pakwNKWAxVgc_UHHcBiDmoQ_2MI4gEoCQ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16508869616662975038/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlhhVTU1U2w5UlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16508869616662975038/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlhhVTU1U2w5UlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16508869616662975038/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlhhVTU1U2w5UlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16508869616662975038/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlhhVTU1U2w5UlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16508869616662975038/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlhhVTU1U2w5UlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16508869616662975038/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUlhhVTU1U2w5UlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["感謝您的評價~\n也謝謝您的支持 與喜歡～\n很開心店裡的環境和食物都讓您感到滿意\n下次可